{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43771240/4090ac7d88d178c465f158d170771fd1cadad448.png

Get ready to dive back into the heartbreaking world of horror and survival in "Dead City"!
The zombie shooter is getting its first major update filled with exciting new features and much-anticipated improvements. It promises to push the boundaries of your gaming experience. Let's take a look at the latest additions that will not leave you indifferent.

In addition to the game, 2 DLCs have been released:

Dead City: Sci-Fi Pack
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43771240/862f03818415143877f922d76e72c4b33652866d.png
DLC contains:

 Character "Stormtrooper" - Has good defense and mobility, but does not shoot very accurately;
 Energy rifle "Energo-Star" - Has no ammo, consumes a charge when firing, the charge is restored over time;
 "Energo-Saber" - Chance when attacking to release energy that repels enemies;
 250 caps;
 5000 coins.


Dead City: Street Fighter Pack
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43771240/b7a115c39e14b9f1f98e418eea9d9e6cddb86720.png
DLC contains:

 Character "Adam Stone" - The bouncer who worked in the institutions of the old city, his knuckles are always with him;
 Character "Blaze Valentine" - The best shooter on the streets of the old city, loves weapons - a lot of weapons, a lot of weapons;
 "Double SMG" - Double shot, double damage, double ammo consumption;
 "Brass Knuckles" - Increased attack speed, stun with every attack;
 250 caps;
 5000 coins.


Innovations:

 Added night maps. The ambient sound has been changed to night. Night maps are chosen randomly;
 Added flashes from shots and explosions;
 Added highlighting drops;
 Added light from Molotov fire and gas grenade;
 Added backlight for toxic and exploding zombies;
 Added weather conditions - rain and fog. Weather conditions change randomly.


Changes:

 Increased the chance of dropping items from boxes;
 Increased the number of parts and electrical tape in the drop;
 Increased the number of coins and caps in the drop.


Corrections:

 Fixed "repair" of a broken weapon after dropping it to the ground and then picking it up;
 Fixed inconsistency in character names in dialogues and in the main menu;
 Fixed animation of evacuation of surviving characters;
 Fixed player getting knocked up by a bunch of infected.


Brace yourself for a relentless battle against the undead as you uncover the truth about the infection of an entire city and survive in the nightmarish world of "Dead City"!
